  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Center for Human Rights - 2017-2021- Efficiency Audit</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center for Human Rights - 2017-2021-Efficiency Audit - Center for Human Rights - 2017-2021, Efficiency Audit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An academic/research institute called the Centre for Human Rights(CHR) has submitted a project proposal to Sida. Sida is interested to engage with CHR but before it does so, it has decided to carry out an efficiency audit of the CHR. The current call-off contract is prepared based on a framework agreement that the embassy has concluded with the audit firm that will carry out the efficiency audit. Based on a TOR and the call-off contract, the selected audit firm will carry out an efficiency audit of the CHR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett akademiskt/forskningsinstitut kallat Centrum f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter (CHR) har l&#xe4;mnat in ett projektf&#xf6;rslag till Sida. Sida &#xe4;r intresserad av att engagera sig i CHR men innan det g&#xf6;r det har man beslutat att genomf&#xf6;ra en effektivitetsrevision av CHR. Nuvarande avropskontrakt uppr&#xe4;ttas utifr&#xe5;n ett ramavtal som ambassaden har slutit med den revisionsbyr&#xe5; som ska utf&#xf6;ra effektivitetsrevisionen. Baserat p&#xe5; en TOR och avropskontraktet kommer det valda revisionsf&#xf6;retaget att genomf&#xf6;ra en effektivitetsrevision av CHR.</narrative>
  </description>
